	(text "03_OUTPUT_STAGE REV0.2 GATE C: LT1970A TSSOP-20 + DEC-014/026/028" (at 10 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)))
	(text "Power: V+ +12V_A (dec 100nF+10uF), V- -12V_A (100nF+10uF), VCC +12V_A, VEE -12V_A, EP=V- solder" (at 10 20 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)))
	(text "Signals: OUT -> R_iso FIT ONE ONLY (R301 33 DNP loop-tune, R302 47 PRIMARY) -> FORCE_HI; SENSE+->FORCE_LO Kelvin, SENSE- -> GND, FILTER -> C301 DNP 1n-100n to SENSE- (1k int)" (at 10 25 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)))
	(text "Control: +IN=VSET (AD5764 via 02 slew provision), -IN=VDIFF_FB (Kelvin diff from 04), VCSRC/SNK 0-5V via 1k + 5.1V Zener to COM, ENABLE pull-down 47k HW-safe, ISRC/ISNK 10k to +3V3 OC, COM=GND" (at 10 30 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)))
	(text "VEE 10/11/20/21 -> -12V_A (4x VEE + EP), TSD pin18 OC 10k->3V3, ISRC/ISNK OC, EP thermal pad via 4x to GND plane (stitched to V-)" (at 10 35 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)))
	(text "R_iso provision: NOT PARALLEL, FIT ONE ONLY - layout two pads overlapping selectable; default R302 47R sweet spot (P3IR-02), R301 33 DNP for prototype" (at 10 100 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)))
	(text "FILTER C301: DNP/open baseline (1970afc 1n-100n) - prev 220p outside range now DNP, prototype 1n/10n/100n" (at 10 105 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)))
	(text "Wiring: VSET->+IN, VDIFF_FB->-IN, FORCE_HI net to DUT_HI (09), FORCE_LO/SENSE_P/N to shunt (05), ISRC/ISNK to MCU (08), VCSRC/SNK to DAC (02), ENABLE to MCU+supervisor (08)" (at 10 110 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)))
